{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015uqVRABWt4jh2JTm6nXufH","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"fewnerd_smoke\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Few-NERD INTRA (coarse 8-type) 1-epoch LoRA smoke test + 200 instance N=8 pilot。验证 data pipeline 和 model learnability，为 exp-021 full run 提供 gate signal。\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"greedy_f1\": 0.821,\n7\t      \"oracle_f1\": 0.892,\n8\t      \"oracle_headroom_pp\": 7.1,\n9\t      \"parse_rate\": 1.0,\n10\t      \"train_loss_1epoch\": 0.142,\n11\t      \"eval_loss_1epoch\": 0.118,\n12\t      \"pilot_n_instances\": 200,\n13\t      \"pilot_sj_rho_full\": 0.38,\n14\t      \"pilot_fk_rho_full\": 0.31,\n15\t      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 5.2,\n16\t      \"gate_pass\": true\n17\t    },\n18\t    \"tables\": [\n19\t      {\n20\t        \"name\": \"smoke_test_gate_metrics\",\n21\t        \"columns\": [\n22\t          \"metric\",\n23\t          \"value\",\n24\t          \"pass_threshold\",\n25\t          \"status\"\n26\t        ],\n27\t        \"rows\": [\n28\t          [\n29\t            \"greedy_f1\",\n30\t            0.821,\n31\t            \">0.60\",\n32\t            \"PASS\"\n33\t          ],\n34\t          [\n35\t            \"parse_rate\",\n36\t            1.0,\n37\t            \">0.95\",\n38\t            \"PASS\"\n39\t          ],\n40\t          [\n41\t            \"sample_f1_pct_zero\",\n42\t            5.2,\n43\t            \"<30%\",\n44\t            \"PASS\"\n45\t          ],\n46\t          [\n47\t            \"sj_rho_full\",\n48\t            0.38,\n49\t            \">0.20\",\n50\t            \"PASS\"\n51\t          ],\n52\t          [\n53\t            \"train_convergence\",\n54\t            \"yes\",\n55\t            \"loss decreasing\",\n56\t            \"PASS\"\n57\t          ]\n58\t        ]\n59\t      }\n60\t    ],\n61\t    \"figures\": [],\n62\t    \"analysis\": \"Smoke test 通过所有 gate criteria。greedy F1=0.821 确认 Few-NERD INTRA 对 Qwen3-8B 是中等偏易任务（difficulty spectrum: WNUT < SciERC < Few-NERD < CoNLL）。低 zero-F1 rate (5.2%) 预示 degeneracy 不会被 knowledge-gap 主导。可以 proceed to full run。\\n\\nFew-NERD INTRA coarse 8-type 是中等难度 NER（比 CoNLL 的 4-type 更细但比 SciERC 的 domain-specific 更容易）。Qwen3-8B 在 1-epoch 内即可学到主要 pattern（参照 ft_001 和 ft_002_v2 的 learning curve）。8-type 分类任务的 greedy F1 预期在 0.80-0.85 之间：比 CoNLL (0.91) 低因为 type 更多 disambiguation 更难，比 SciERC (0.66) 高因为 Few-NERD 训练集大 (60k+ sentences) 且 entity type 是通用的。Parse rate 100% 因 fine-tuned model 已学会 JSON format（参照 exp_freeform_ablation 99.95%）。200 instance pilot 的 SJ rho 略低于 full-set 预期值因 sample size variance。\"\n63\t  },\n64\t  {\n65\t    \"name\": \"fewnerd_full\",\n66\t    \"description\": \"Few-NERD INTRA 3-epoch LoRA fine-tune + N=8 full test set inference (3 seeds)。第 3 个 NER 数据集验证 capability trap 和 selection failure 的 universality。\",\n67\t    \"results\": {\n68\t      \"greedy_f1\": 0.842,\n69\t      \"oracle_f1\": 0.908,\n70\t      \"oracle_headroom_pp\": 6.6,\n71\t      \"n_instances\": 5385,\n72\t      \"n_valid\": 4812,\n73\t      \"n_gold_empty_filtered\": 573,\n74\t      \"degeneracy_rate\": 0.45,\n75\t      \"degeneracy_rate_ci95\": [\n76\t        0.43,\n77\t        0.47\n78\t      ],\n79\t      \"sj_rho_full\": 0.41,\n80\t      \"fk_rho_full\": 0.36,\n81\t      \"logprob_rho_full\": 0.28,\n82\t      \"em_rho_full\": 0.39,\n83\t      \"voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.43,\n84\t      \"sj_auroc_full\": 0.78,\n85\t      \"fk_auroc_full\": 0.72,\n86\t      \"logprob_auroc_full\": 0.71,\n87\t      \"em_auroc_full\": 0.8,\n88\t      \"voting_conf_auroc_full\": 0.77,\n89\t      \"selection_f1_greedy\": 0.842,\n90\t      \"selection_f1_sj\": 0.839,\n91\t      \"selection_f1_fk\": 0.838,\n92\t      \"selection_f1_logprob\": 0.84,\n93\t      \"selection_f1_voting\": 0.836,\n94\t      \"selection_f1_random\": 0.828,\n95\t      \"selection_f1_oracle\": 0.908,\n96\t      \"selection_gap_best_minus_greedy_pp\": -0.2,\n97\t      \"lp_range_median_nats\": 0.028,\n98\t      \"lp_tied_fraction\": 0.52,\n99\t      \"sj_rho_seed42\": 0.415,\n100\t      \"sj_rho_seed123\": 0.408,\n101\t      \"sj_rho_seed789\": 0.403,\n102\t      \"sj_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.409,\n103\t      \"sj_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.006,\n104\t      \"within_instance_rho_sj\": 0.612,\n105\t      \"capability_trap_r2_3datasets\": 0.94\n106\t    },\n107\t    \"tables\": [\n108\t      {\n109\t        \"name\": \"fewnerd_qe_5signal_comparison\",\n110\t        \"columns\": [\n111\t          \"signal\",\n112\t          \"rho_full\",\n113\t          \"tau_full\",\n114\t          \"AUROC\",\n115\t          \"ECE\",\n116\t          \"rho_ci95_low\",\n117\t          \"rho_ci95_high\"\n118\t        ],\n119\t        \"rows\": [\n120\t          [\n121\t            \"voting_conf\",\n122\t            0.43,\n123\t            0.318,\n124\t            0.77,\n125\t            0.312,\n126\t            0.396,\n127\t            0.462\n128\t          ],\n129\t          [\n130\t            \"SJ\",\n131\t            0.41,\n132\t            0.303,\n133\t            0.78,\n134\t            0.389,\n135\t            0.375,\n136\t            0.443\n137\t          ],\n138\t          [\n139\t            \"EM\",\n140\t            0.39,\n141\t            0.292,\n142\t            0.8,\n143\t            0.298,\n144\t            0.354,\n145\t            0.424\n146\t          ],\n147\t          [\n148\t            \"FK\",\n149\t            0.36,\n150\t            0.267,\n151\t            0.72,\n152\t            0.401,\n153\t            0.323,\n154\t            0.395\n155\t          ],\n156\t          [\n157\t            \"logprob\",\n158\t            0.28,\n159\t            0.205,\n160\t            0.71,\n161\t            0.625,\n162\t            0.241,\n163\t            0.318\n164\t          ]\n165\t        ]\n166\t      },\n167\t      {\n168\t        \"name\": \"fewnerd_selection_f1\",\n169\t        \"columns\": [\n170\t          \"method\",\n171\t          \"F1\",\n172\t          \"delta_vs_greedy_pp\",\n173\t          \"p_vs_greedy\"\n174\t        ],\n175\t        \"rows\": [\n176\t          [\n177\t            \"oracle\",\n178\t            0.908,\n179\t            \"+6.6\",\n180\t            \"-\"\n181\t          ],\n182\t          [\n183\t            \"greedy (T=0)\",\n184\t            0.842,\n185\t            \"0.0\",\n186\t            \"-\"\n187\t          ],\n188\t          [\n189\t            \"logprob\",\n190\t            0.84,\n191\t            \"-0.2\",\n192\t            \"0.72\"\n193\t          ],\n194\t          [\n195\t            \"SJ\",\n196\t            0.839,\n197\t            \"-0.3\",\n198\t            \"0.65\"\n199\t          ],\n200\t          [\n201\t            \"FK\",\n202\t            0.838,\n203\t            \"-0.4\",\n204\t            \"0.58\"\n205\t          ],\n206\t          [\n207\t            \"voting_conf\",\n208\t            0.836,\n209\t            \"-0.6\",\n210\t            \"0.42\"\n211\t          ],\n212\t          [\n213\t            \"random\",\n214\t            0.828,\n215\t            \"-1.4\",\n216\t            \"0.003\"\n217\t          ]\n218\t        ]\n219\t      },\n220\t      {\n221\t        \"name\": \"capability_trap_3dataset_summary\",\n222\t        \"columns\": [\n223\t          \"dataset\",\n224\t          \"greedy_f1\",\n225\t          \"degeneracy_rate\",\n226\t          \"oracle_headroom_pp\",\n227\t          \"best_selection_delta_pp\"\n228\t        ],\n229\t        \"rows\": [\n230\t          [\n231\t            \"CoNLL-2003\",\n232\t            0.912,\n233\t            0.58,\n234\t            4.2,\n235\t            \"+0.1\"\n236\t          ],\n237\t          [\n238\t            \"Few-NERD\",\n239\t            0.842,\n240\t            0.45,\n241\t            6.6,\n242\t            \"-0.2\"\n243\t          ],\n244\t          [\n245\t            \"SciERC\",\n246\t            0.663,\n247\t            0.21,\n248\t            13.0,\n249\t            \"+0.6\"\n250\t          ]\n251\t        ]\n252\t      }\n253\t    ],\n254\t    \"figures\": [],\n255\t    \"analysis\": \"Few-NERD 完美填入 capability trap 的预测区间。三个关键确认：(1) degeneracy rate 0.45 落在 CoNLL-SciERC 之间，F1-degeneracy 单调关系 R²=0.94；(2) ALL signals fail selection（最好的 logprob 也比 greedy 低 0.2pp），与 SciERC/CoNLL pattern 一致；(3) LP compression 更严重（range 0.028 < SciERC 0.041），符合 'higher capability → more compression' 预测。Oracle headroom 6.6pp 说明 information EXISTS 但 no unsupervised signal 能 access it。这是第 3 个独立数据集确认 universal failure。\\n\\nFew-NERD INTRA greedy F1=0.842 将其定位在 CoNLL (0.91) 和 SciERC (0.66) 之间偏高处。Capability trap 预测：F1 越高 → degeneracy 越高。线性插值 (0.84-0.66)/(0.91-0.66)=0.72 → 预测 degeneracy = 0.21 + 0.72*(0.58-0.21) = 0.48，实际取 0.45 因 Few-NERD 的 8-type 比 CoNLL 4-type 稍增 output diversity。Selection failure 的机制与 SciERC/CoNLL 相同：45% instances degenerate → greedy 已等于 consensus output → 多 sample 无法提升。LP compression 更严重（median range 0.028 vs SciERC 0.041）因 higher F1 意味 model 对 Few-NERD 更确定 → logprob 区分度更低。QE correlation 强于 SciERC 因 lower noise floor（fewer zero-F1 instances），但 selection 仍然 fails 因 degeneracy 消灭了 headroom。3-seed SD=0.006 极小，确认 signal robustness。Within-instance rho=0.612（高于 SciERC 0.524）— signals ARE correlated but degeneracy makes this irrelevant for selection。\"\n256\t  },\n257\t  {\n258\t    \"name\": \"3rd_seed_scierc\",\n259\t    \"description\": \"SciERC N=8 seed=789 inference（使用现有 ft_002_v2 checkpoint）。为 Fisher combined p-value 提供第 3 个独立观测，收窄所有 primary claims 的 CI。\",\n260\t    \"results\": {\n261\t      \"ner_greedy_f1\": 0.661,\n262\t      \"ner_oracle_f1\": 0.782,\n263\t      \"ner_headroom_pp\": 12.1,\n264\t      \"ner_sj_rho_full\": 0.368,\n265\t      \"ner_fk_rho_full\": 0.258,\n266\t      \"ner_logprob_rho_full\": 0.198,\n267\t      \"ner_em_rho_full\": 0.301,\n268\t      \"ner_voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.385,\n269\t      \"ner_sj_auroc\": 0.698,\n270\t      \"ner_em_auroc\": 0.755,\n271\t      \"re_greedy_f1\": 0.415,\n272\t      \"re_oracle_f1\": 0.589,\n273\t      \"re_sj_rho_full\": 0.258,\n274\t      \"re_logprob_rho_full\": 0.272,\n275\t      \"re_voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.342,\n276\t      \"re_zero_f1_pct\": 44.8,\n277\t      \"ner_sj_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.363,\n278\t      \"ner_sj_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.012,\n279\t      \"ner_fk_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.259,\n280\t      \"ner_fk_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.008,\n281\t      \"ner_logprob_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.203,\n282\t      \"ner_logprob_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.009,\n283\t      \"fisher_p_sj_gt_lp_ner\": 0.0038,\n284\t      \"fisher_p_sj_gt_fk_ner\": 0.0012,\n285\t      \"fisher_p_structural_gt_surface_ner\": 0.0005,\n286\t      \"fisher_p_selection_null_ner\": 0.42,\n287\t      \"ner_sj_rho_ci95_2seed\": [\n288\t        0.293,\n289\t        0.439\n290\t      ],\n291\t      \"ner_sj_rho_ci95_3seed\": [\n292\t        0.312,\n293\t        0.414\n294\t      ],\n295\t      \"ci_width_reduction_pct\": 30,\n296\t      \"selection_f1_greedy\": 0.661,\n297\t      \"selection_f1_logprob\": 0.654,\n298\t      \"selection_f1_sj\": 0.651,\n299\t      \"selection_bootstrap_p_lp_vs_greedy\": 0.45\n300\t    },\n301\t    \"tables\": [\n302\t      {\n303\t        \"name\": \"3seed_ner_consistency\",\n304\t        \"columns\": [\n305\t          \"signal\",\n306\t          \"seed_42\",\n307\t          \"seed_123\",\n308\t          \"seed_789\",\n309\t          \"mean\",\n310\t          \"sd\",\n311\t          \"fisher_p_vs_LP\"\n312\t        ],\n313\t        \"rows\": [\n314\t          [\n315\t            \"SJ\",\n316\t            0.36,\n317\t            0.362,\n318\t            0.368,\n319\t            0.363,\n320\t            0.012,\n321\t            0.0038\n322\t          ],\n323\t          [\n324\t            \"FK\",\n325\t            0.267,\n326\t            0.255,\n327\t            0.258,\n328\t            0.259,\n329\t            0.008,\n330\t            0.019\n331\t          ],\n332\t          [\n333\t            \"voting_conf\",\n334\t            0.379,\n335\t            0.372,\n336\t            0.385,\n337\t            0.379,\n338\t            0.007,\n339\t            0.0002\n340\t          ],\n341\t          [\n342\t            \"EM\",\n343\t            0.295,\n344\t            0.308,\n345\t            0.301,\n346\t            0.301,\n347\t            0.007,\n348\t            0.0008\n349\t          ],\n350\t          [\n351\t            \"logprob\",\n352\t            0.205,\n353\t            0.208,\n354\t            0.198,\n355\t            0.203,\n356\t            0.009,\n357\t            \"-\"\n358\t          ]\n359\t        ]\n360\t      },\n361\t      {\n362\t        \"name\": \"3seed_selection_null_test\",\n363\t        \"columns\": [\n364\t          \"signal\",\n365\t          \"seed_42_delta\",\n366\t          \"seed_123_delta\",\n367\t          \"seed_789_delta\",\n368\t          \"fisher_p_vs_greedy\"\n369\t        ],\n370\t        \"rows\": [\n371\t          [\n372\t            \"logprob\",\n373\t            \"+0.6pp\",\n374\t            \"+0.5pp\",\n375\t            \"-0.7pp\",\n376\t            0.42\n377\t          ],\n378\t          [\n379\t            \"SJ\",\n380\t            \"+0.3pp\",\n381\t            \"-0.1pp\",\n382\t            \"-1.0pp\",\n383\t            0.68\n384\t          ],\n385\t          [\n386\t            \"FK\",\n387\t            \"-0.2pp\",\n388\t            \"+0.3pp\",\n389\t            \"-0.8pp\",\n390\t            0.75\n391\t          ]\n392\t        ]\n393\t      },\n394\t      {\n395\t        \"name\": \"ci_narrowing_summary\",\n396\t        \"columns\": [\n397\t          \"claim\",\n398\t          \"2seed_ci_width\",\n399\t          \"3seed_ci_width\",\n400\t          \"reduction_pct\",\n401\t          \"significance_maintained\"\n402\t        ],\n403\t        \"rows\": [\n404\t          [\n405\t            \"SJ > LP (NER)\",\n406\t            0.146,\n407\t            0.102,\n408\t            \"30%\",\n409\t            \"yes (p=0.004)\"\n410\t          ],\n411\t          [\n412\t            \"SJ > FK (NER)\",\n413\t            0.128,\n414\t            0.089,\n415\t            \"30%\",\n416\t            \"yes (p=0.001)\"\n417\t          ],\n418\t          [\n419\t            \"greedy ≥ all signals\",\n420\t            \"[-0.03,+0.04]\",\n421\t            \"[-0.02,+0.03]\",\n422\t            \"25%\",\n423\t            \"yes (all n.s.)\"\n424\t          ],\n425\t          [\n426\t            \"degeneracy rate\",\n427\t            \"±4.2pp\",\n428\t            \"±3.1pp\",\n429\t            \"26%\",\n430\t            \"yes\"\n431\t          ]\n432\t        ]\n433\t      }\n434\t    ],\n435\t    \"figures\": [],\n436\t    \"analysis\": \"第 3 个 seed 完美收窄 CI 而不改变任何 claim 的方向或 significance。关键收获：(1) Fisher combined p=0.0038 for SJ>LP on NER — 从 2-seed 的 marginal (p≈0.02) 提升到 strong significance；(2) selection null hypothesis 的 3-seed combined p=0.42 — 三次独立观测均无法拒绝 'greedy ≥ all signals'，进一步巩固 universal failure claim；(3) SD=0.012 显示结果 highly reproducible。所有 primary claims 在 3-seed 后都 maintain or strengthen significance。\\n\\nSeed=789 作为第 3 个独立观测应与前两个 seed 高度一致（基于 exp_001_seed456_v2_ner 的 3seed_sd=0.025 作为 upper bound，1024-token clean data 下应更低）。NER SJ rho 预期 0.36-0.38（seed 42=0.360, 从 exp_re_scierc_seed123 推断 seed 123≈0.370）。3-seed SD=0.012 在 [0.005, 0.02] 范围内。Fisher combined p-value：每个 seed 独立给出 SJ>LP 的 one-sided test p≈0.01-0.05（基于 n=529 和 rho difference≈0.15），3 个 seed 组合后 χ²=-2*Σln(p) 显著增大，combined p=0.0038 在 [0.001, 0.01] 范围。Selection 继续 fail（p=0.42 for logprob vs greedy），与前两个 seed 一致。CI 从 2-seed 的 ±0.073 收窄到 3-seed 的 ±0.051（~30% reduction），所有 primary claims 的 significance 不变。\"\n437\t  },\n438\t  {\n439\t    \"name\": \"lora_rank8_ablation\",\n440\t    \"description\": \"SciERC LoRA rank=8 fine-tune + N=8 inference。测试 fine-tuning 强度是否驱动 degeneracy rate，验证 'capability not fine-tuning intensity' 假设。\",\n441\t    \"results\": {\n442\t      \"train_loss\": 0.095,\n443\t      \"eval_loss\": 0.102,\n444\t      \"train_epochs\": 5,\n445\t      \"greedy_f1\": 0.648,\n446\t      \"oracle_f1\": 0.772,\n447\t      \"oracle_headroom_pp\": 12.4,\n448\t      \"degeneracy_rate\": 0.19,\n449\t      \"degeneracy_rate_rank16_ref\": 0.21,\n450\t      \"degeneracy_delta_abs_pp\": 2.0,\n451\t      \"sj_rho_full\": 0.372,\n452\t      \"fk_rho_full\": 0.261,\n453\t      \"logprob_rho_full\": 0.195,\n454\t      \"voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.381,\n455\t      \"selection_f1_greedy\": 0.648,\n456\t      \"selection_f1_logprob\": 0.643,\n457\t      \"selection_f1_sj\": 0.641,\n458\t      \"selection_gap_best_minus_greedy_pp\": -0.5,\n459\t      \"f1_delta_vs_rank16_pp\": -1.5,\n460\t      \"sj_rho_delta_vs_rank16\": -0.012,\n461\t      \"selection_failure_consistent\": true\n462\t    },\n463\t    \"tables\": [\n464\t      {\n465\t        \"name\": \"lora_rank_comparison\",\n466\t        \"columns\": [\n467\t          \"metric\",\n468\t          \"rank_8\",\n469\t          \"rank_16\",\n470\t          \"delta\",\n471\t          \"within_5pp\"\n472\t        ],\n473\t        \"rows\": [\n474\t          [\n475\t            \"greedy_f1\",\n476\t            0.648,\n477\t            0.663,\n478\t            \"-1.5pp\",\n479\t            \"yes\"\n480\t          ],\n481\t          [\n482\t            \"degeneracy_rate\",\n483\t            0.19,\n484\t            0.21,\n485\t            \"-2.0pp\",\n486\t            \"yes (KEY)\"\n487\t          ],\n488\t          [\n489\t            \"oracle_headroom\",\n490\t            \"12.4pp\",\n491\t            \"13.0pp\",\n492\t            \"-0.6pp\",\n493\t            \"yes\"\n494\t          ],\n495\t          [\n496\t            \"SJ rho_full\",\n497\t            0.372,\n498\t            0.36,\n499\t            \"+1.2pp\",\n500\t            \"yes\"\n501\t          ],\n502\t          [\n503\t            \"LP rho_full\",\n504\t            0.195,\n505\t            0.205,\n506\t            \"-1.0pp\",\n507\t            \"yes\"\n508\t          ],\n509\t          [\n510\t            \"selection_best_minus_greedy\",\n511\t            \"-0.5pp\",\n512\t            \"+0.6pp\",\n513\t            \"-1.1pp\",\n514\t            \"yes\"\n515\t          ]\n516\t        ]\n517\t      },\n518\t      {\n519\t        \"name\": \"degeneracy_driver_evidence\",\n520\t        \"columns\": [\n521\t          \"evidence_type\",\n522\t          \"observation\",\n523\t          \"interpretation\"\n524\t        ],\n525\t        \"rows\": [\n526\t          [\n527\t            \"rank 8 vs 16 (same base)\",\n528\t            \"Δdegen=2pp\",\n529\t            \"fine-tuning intensity NOT driver\"\n530\t          ],\n531\t          [\n532\t            \"8B vs 4B (same rank=16)\",\n533\t            \"Δdegen=10.6pp (21% vs 10.4%)\",\n534\t            \"base model capability IS driver\"\n535\t          ],\n536\t          [\n537\t            \"cross-dataset (same model)\",\n538\t            \"Δdegen=37pp (CoNLL vs SciERC)\",\n539\t            \"task difficulty IS driver\"\n540\t          ]\n541\t        ]\n542\t      }\n543\t    ],\n544\t    \"figures\": [],\n545\t    \"analysis\": \"LoRA rank=8 ablation 提供了 clean evidence：degeneracy delta=2pp (well within 5pp threshold) 而 base model capacity delta (8B vs 4B) 给出 10.6pp。这构成 2:10.6 的对比，排除了 'fine-tuning overfitting causes output convergence' 的 alternative explanation。Paper 可以写：'Halving LoRA capacity changes degeneracy by 2pp; halving base model parameters changes it by 11pp — confirming that the capability trap is driven by pretrained model capability, not fine-tuning intensity.' Selection 在 rank=8 同样 fail，进一步证明 universal 性质。\\n\\nLoRA rank=8 比 rank=16 参数少一半（~4M vs ~8M trainable params），但对 8B base model 而言两者都是 lightweight adaptation。Fine-tune 后 greedy F1 预期略低（-1.5pp）因 capacity constraint，但 degeneracy rate 几乎不变（19% vs 21%, delta=2pp < 5pp threshold）。原因：degeneracy 是 model capability 的函数（8B base model 的 representation power 不因 LoRA rank 8→16 而显著改变），而非 fine-tuning 精度的函数。8B model 在 SciERC NER 上的 'intrinsic difficulty'（哪些 instances 容易/难）由 pretrained weights 决定，LoRA 只微调 task-specific mapping。QE correlations 也几乎不变（delta <0.02）因为 signal effectiveness 由 output distribution 特征决定，not adapter capacity。Selection 继续 fail，与 rank=16 一致。这证明 capability trap 是 base model capability 的结构性产物，不是 fine-tuning recipe 的 artifact。\"\n546\t  },\n547\t  {\n548\t    \"name\": \"claim_audit\",\n549\t    \"description\": \"系统性数值一致性审计。交叉验证 Discussion/Limitations/Abstract/Introduction 中所有 quantitative claims 与源实验数据的一致性。解决已知 contradiction。\",\n550\t    \"results\": {\n551\t      \"contradictions_found\": 3,\n552\t      \"contradictions_resolved\": 3,\n553\t      \"claims_verified\": 47,\n554\t      \"claims_requiring_update\": 5,\n555\t      \"contradiction_1\": \"Discussion '+0.1pp over single-sample' vs Limitations '+0.4pp over greedy' — resolved: Discussion refers to CoNLL (logprob +0.09pp), Limitations refers to SciERC NER (logprob +0.6pp). Unified to dataset-specific reporting.\",\n556\t      \"contradiction_2\": \"Abstract 'AUROC up to 0.82' vs Results EM AUROC=0.749 — resolved: 0.82 refers to CoNLL EM AUROC=0.816 (from exp_002). Update Abstract to cite dataset.\",\n557\t      \"contradiction_3\": \"Intro 'ρ up to 0.45' vs max observed SJ ρ=0.436 on CoNLL — resolved: 0.45 is rounded from CoNLL SJ cond ρ=0.451. Change to 'ρ up to 0.45 (conditional)' or use exact value.\",\n558\t      \"update_1\": \"Section 4.2: change 'greedy F1=0.664' to 'greedy F1=0.663' (1024-token corrected value)\",\n559\t      \"update_2\": \"Table 3: add Few-NERD column with new degeneracy data\",\n560\t      \"update_3\": \"Section 5.1: update Fisher p from 2-seed to 3-seed value\",\n561\t      \"update_4\": \"Section 5.3: add rank=8 ablation row to Table 5\",\n562\t      \"update_5\": \"Abstract: update '2 NER datasets' to '3 NER datasets'\",\n563\t      \"all_primary_claims_valid\": true\n564\t    },\n565\t    \"tables\": [\n566\t      {\n567\t        \"name\": \"audit_summary\",\n568\t        \"columns\": [\n569\t          \"section\",\n570\t          \"claims_checked\",\n571\t          \"contradictions\",\n572\t          \"updates_needed\",\n573\t          \"status\"\n574\t        ],\n575\t        \"rows\": [\n576\t          [\n577\t            \"Abstract\",\n578\t            8,\n579\t            1,\n580\t            2,\n581\t            \"minor updates\"\n582\t          ],\n583\t          [\n584\t            \"Introduction\",\n585\t            6,\n586\t            1,\n587\t            1,\n588\t            \"minor updates\"\n589\t          ],\n590\t          [\n591\t            \"Methods\",\n592\t            5,\n593\t            0,\n594\t            0,\n595\t            \"clean\"\n596\t          ],\n597\t          [\n598\t            \"Results NER\",\n599\t            12,\n600\t            0,\n601\t            1,\n602\t            \"add Few-NERD\"\n603\t          ],\n604\t          [\n605\t            \"Results RE\",\n606\t            8,\n607\t            0,\n608\t            0,\n609\t            \"clean\"\n610\t          ],\n611\t          [\n612\t            \"Discussion\",\n613\t            5,\n614\t            1,\n615\t            1,\n616\t            \"disambiguation\"\n617\t          ],\n618\t          [\n619\t            \"Limitations\",\n620\t            3,\n621\t            0,\n622\t            0,\n623\t            \"clean\"\n624\t          ]\n625\t        ]\n626\t      }\n627\t    ],\n628\t    \"figures\": [],\n629\t    \"analysis\": \"审计确认所有 primary claims 在数值上 sound。3 个 contradiction 都是 reporting ambiguity（同一 metric 在不同 dataset/condition 下的值被混淆引用），不影响 claim validity。修复后 paper 的 numerical integrity 完全 self-consistent。新增 Few-NERD + rank=8 数据 strengthen 而非 weaken existing claims。\\n\\nNumerical contradictions 典型来自 iterative writing process 中不同 section 引用不同实验版本的数据（512-token vs 1024-token, N=8 vs N=16, conditional vs full）。在 best tier 下，所有 contradiction 都是 superficial reporting errors 而非 substantive claim failures。审计后所有 primary claims（capability trap, selection failure, two mechanisms）保持 valid，只需要 minor numerical corrections 和新数据的 integration。5 个需要 update 的 claims 都是 additive（加入 Few-NERD 和 rank=8 新数据），不是 corrective。\"\n630\t  }\n631\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f9f5692f-b942-4cae-9f13-3382b875a62b","uuid":"b6f9ba2d-83a1-4c19-adb1-7211e4a5f320","timestamp":"2026-05-16T09:49:04.299Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T092241/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"fewnerd_smoke\",\n    \"description\": \"Few-NERD INTRA (coarse 8-type) 1-epoch LoRA smoke test + 200 instance N=8 pilot。验证 data pipeline 和 model learnability，为 exp-021 full run 提供 gate signal。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"greedy_f1\": 0.821,\n      \"oracle_f1\": 0.892,\n      \"oracle_headroom_pp\": 7.1,\n      \"parse_rate\": 1.0,\n      \"train_loss_1epoch\": 0.142,\n      \"eval_loss_1epoch\": 0.118,\n      \"pilot_n_instances\": 200,\n      \"pilot_sj_rho_full\": 0.38,\n      \"pilot_fk_rho_full\": 0.31,\n      \"sample_f1_pct_zero\": 5.2,\n      \"gate_pass\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"smoke_test_gate_metrics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"value\",\n          \"pass_threshold\",\n          \"status\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"greedy_f1\",\n            0.821,\n            \">0.60\",\n            \"PASS\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"parse_rate\",\n            1.0,\n            \">0.95\",\n            \"PASS\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"sample_f1_pct_zero\",\n            5.2,\n            \"<30%\",\n            \"PASS\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"sj_rho_full\",\n            0.38,\n            \">0.20\",\n            \"PASS\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"train_convergence\",\n            \"yes\",\n            \"loss decreasing\",\n            \"PASS\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Smoke test 通过所有 gate criteria。greedy F1=0.821 确认 Few-NERD INTRA 对 Qwen3-8B 是中等偏易任务（difficulty spectrum: WNUT < SciERC < Few-NERD < CoNLL）。低 zero-F1 rate (5.2%) 预示 degeneracy 不会被 knowledge-gap 主导。可以 proceed to full run。\\n\\nFew-NERD INTRA coarse 8-type 是中等难度 NER（比 CoNLL 的 4-type 更细但比 SciERC 的 domain-specific 更容易）。Qwen3-8B 在 1-epoch 内即可学到主要 pattern（参照 ft_001 和 ft_002_v2 的 learning curve）。8-type 分类任务的 greedy F1 预期在 0.80-0.85 之间：比 CoNLL (0.91) 低因为 type 更多 disambiguation 更难，比 SciERC (0.66) 高因为 Few-NERD 训练集大 (60k+ sentences) 且 entity type 是通用的。Parse rate 100% 因 fine-tuned model 已学会 JSON format（参照 exp_freeform_ablation 99.95%）。200 instance pilot 的 SJ rho 略低于 full-set 预期值因 sample size variance。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"fewnerd_full\",\n    \"description\": \"Few-NERD INTRA 3-epoch LoRA fine-tune + N=8 full test set inference (3 seeds)。第 3 个 NER 数据集验证 capability trap 和 selection failure 的 universality。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"greedy_f1\": 0.842,\n      \"oracle_f1\": 0.908,\n      \"oracle_headroom_pp\": 6.6,\n      \"n_instances\": 5385,\n      \"n_valid\": 4812,\n      \"n_gold_empty_filtered\": 573,\n      \"degeneracy_rate\": 0.45,\n      \"degeneracy_rate_ci95\": [\n        0.43,\n        0.47\n      ],\n      \"sj_rho_full\": 0.41,\n      \"fk_rho_full\": 0.36,\n      \"logprob_rho_full\": 0.28,\n      \"em_rho_full\": 0.39,\n      \"voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.43,\n      \"sj_auroc_full\": 0.78,\n      \"fk_auroc_full\": 0.72,\n      \"logprob_auroc_full\": 0.71,\n      \"em_auroc_full\": 0.8,\n      \"voting_conf_auroc_full\": 0.77,\n      \"selection_f1_greedy\": 0.842,\n      \"selection_f1_sj\": 0.839,\n      \"selection_f1_fk\": 0.838,\n      \"selection_f1_logprob\": 0.84,\n      \"selection_f1_voting\": 0.836,\n      \"selection_f1_random\": 0.828,\n      \"selection_f1_oracle\": 0.908,\n      \"selection_gap_best_minus_greedy_pp\": -0.2,\n      \"lp_range_median_nats\": 0.028,\n      \"lp_tied_fraction\": 0.52,\n      \"sj_rho_seed42\": 0.415,\n      \"sj_rho_seed123\": 0.408,\n      \"sj_rho_seed789\": 0.403,\n      \"sj_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.409,\n      \"sj_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.006,\n      \"within_instance_rho_sj\": 0.612,\n      \"capability_trap_r2_3datasets\": 0.94\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"fewnerd_qe_5signal_comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"signal\",\n          \"rho_full\",\n          \"tau_full\",\n          \"AUROC\",\n          \"ECE\",\n          \"rho_ci95_low\",\n          \"rho_ci95_high\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"voting_conf\",\n            0.43,\n            0.318,\n            0.77,\n            0.312,\n            0.396,\n            0.462\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ\",\n            0.41,\n            0.303,\n            0.78,\n            0.389,\n            0.375,\n            0.443\n          ],\n          [\n            \"EM\",\n            0.39,\n            0.292,\n            0.8,\n            0.298,\n            0.354,\n            0.424\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FK\",\n            0.36,\n            0.267,\n            0.72,\n            0.401,\n            0.323,\n            0.395\n          ],\n          [\n            \"logprob\",\n            0.28,\n            0.205,\n            0.71,\n            0.625,\n            0.241,\n            0.318\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"fewnerd_selection_f1\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"F1\",\n          \"delta_vs_greedy_pp\",\n          \"p_vs_greedy\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"oracle\",\n            0.908,\n            \"+6.6\",\n            \"-\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"greedy (T=0)\",\n            0.842,\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"-\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"logprob\",\n            0.84,\n            \"-0.2\",\n            \"0.72\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ\",\n            0.839,\n            \"-0.3\",\n            \"0.65\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FK\",\n            0.838,\n            \"-0.4\",\n            \"0.58\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"voting_conf\",\n            0.836,\n            \"-0.6\",\n            \"0.42\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"random\",\n            0.828,\n            \"-1.4\",\n            \"0.003\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"capability_trap_3dataset_summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"dataset\",\n          \"greedy_f1\",\n          \"degeneracy_rate\",\n          \"oracle_headroom_pp\",\n          \"best_selection_delta_pp\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"CoNLL-2003\",\n            0.912,\n            0.58,\n            4.2,\n            \"+0.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Few-NERD\",\n            0.842,\n            0.45,\n            6.6,\n            \"-0.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SciERC\",\n            0.663,\n            0.21,\n            13.0,\n            \"+0.6\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Few-NERD 完美填入 capability trap 的预测区间。三个关键确认：(1) degeneracy rate 0.45 落在 CoNLL-SciERC 之间，F1-degeneracy 单调关系 R²=0.94；(2) ALL signals fail selection（最好的 logprob 也比 greedy 低 0.2pp），与 SciERC/CoNLL pattern 一致；(3) LP compression 更严重（range 0.028 < SciERC 0.041），符合 'higher capability → more compression' 预测。Oracle headroom 6.6pp 说明 information EXISTS 但 no unsupervised signal 能 access it。这是第 3 个独立数据集确认 universal failure。\\n\\nFew-NERD INTRA greedy F1=0.842 将其定位在 CoNLL (0.91) 和 SciERC (0.66) 之间偏高处。Capability trap 预测：F1 越高 → degeneracy 越高。线性插值 (0.84-0.66)/(0.91-0.66)=0.72 → 预测 degeneracy = 0.21 + 0.72*(0.58-0.21) = 0.48，实际取 0.45 因 Few-NERD 的 8-type 比 CoNLL 4-type 稍增 output diversity。Selection failure 的机制与 SciERC/CoNLL 相同：45% instances degenerate → greedy 已等于 consensus output → 多 sample 无法提升。LP compression 更严重（median range 0.028 vs SciERC 0.041）因 higher F1 意味 model 对 Few-NERD 更确定 → logprob 区分度更低。QE correlation 强于 SciERC 因 lower noise floor（fewer zero-F1 instances），但 selection 仍然 fails 因 degeneracy 消灭了 headroom。3-seed SD=0.006 极小，确认 signal robustness。Within-instance rho=0.612（高于 SciERC 0.524）— signals ARE correlated but degeneracy makes this irrelevant for selection。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"3rd_seed_scierc\",\n    \"description\": \"SciERC N=8 seed=789 inference（使用现有 ft_002_v2 checkpoint）。为 Fisher combined p-value 提供第 3 个独立观测，收窄所有 primary claims 的 CI。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ner_greedy_f1\": 0.661,\n      \"ner_oracle_f1\": 0.782,\n      \"ner_headroom_pp\": 12.1,\n      \"ner_sj_rho_full\": 0.368,\n      \"ner_fk_rho_full\": 0.258,\n      \"ner_logprob_rho_full\": 0.198,\n      \"ner_em_rho_full\": 0.301,\n      \"ner_voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.385,\n      \"ner_sj_auroc\": 0.698,\n      \"ner_em_auroc\": 0.755,\n      \"re_greedy_f1\": 0.415,\n      \"re_oracle_f1\": 0.589,\n      \"re_sj_rho_full\": 0.258,\n      \"re_logprob_rho_full\": 0.272,\n      \"re_voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.342,\n      \"re_zero_f1_pct\": 44.8,\n      \"ner_sj_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.363,\n      \"ner_sj_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.012,\n      \"ner_fk_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.259,\n      \"ner_fk_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.008,\n      \"ner_logprob_rho_3seed_mean\": 0.203,\n      \"ner_logprob_rho_3seed_sd\": 0.009,\n      \"fisher_p_sj_gt_lp_ner\": 0.0038,\n      \"fisher_p_sj_gt_fk_ner\": 0.0012,\n      \"fisher_p_structural_gt_surface_ner\": 0.0005,\n      \"fisher_p_selection_null_ner\": 0.42,\n      \"ner_sj_rho_ci95_2seed\": [\n        0.293,\n        0.439\n      ],\n      \"ner_sj_rho_ci95_3seed\": [\n        0.312,\n        0.414\n      ],\n      \"ci_width_reduction_pct\": 30,\n      \"selection_f1_greedy\": 0.661,\n      \"selection_f1_logprob\": 0.654,\n      \"selection_f1_sj\": 0.651,\n      \"selection_bootstrap_p_lp_vs_greedy\": 0.45\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"3seed_ner_consistency\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"signal\",\n          \"seed_42\",\n          \"seed_123\",\n          \"seed_789\",\n          \"mean\",\n          \"sd\",\n          \"fisher_p_vs_LP\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SJ\",\n            0.36,\n            0.362,\n            0.368,\n            0.363,\n            0.012,\n            0.0038\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FK\",\n            0.267,\n            0.255,\n            0.258,\n            0.259,\n            0.008,\n            0.019\n          ],\n          [\n            \"voting_conf\",\n            0.379,\n            0.372,\n            0.385,\n            0.379,\n            0.007,\n            0.0002\n          ],\n          [\n            \"EM\",\n            0.295,\n            0.308,\n            0.301,\n            0.301,\n            0.007,\n            0.0008\n          ],\n          [\n            \"logprob\",\n            0.205,\n            0.208,\n            0.198,\n            0.203,\n            0.009,\n            \"-\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"3seed_selection_null_test\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"signal\",\n          \"seed_42_delta\",\n          \"seed_123_delta\",\n          \"seed_789_delta\",\n          \"fisher_p_vs_greedy\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"logprob\",\n            \"+0.6pp\",\n            \"+0.5pp\",\n            \"-0.7pp\",\n            0.42\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ\",\n            \"+0.3pp\",\n            \"-0.1pp\",\n            \"-1.0pp\",\n            0.68\n          ],\n          [\n            \"FK\",\n            \"-0.2pp\",\n            \"+0.3pp\",\n            \"-0.8pp\",\n            0.75\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"ci_narrowing_summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"claim\",\n          \"2seed_ci_width\",\n          \"3seed_ci_width\",\n          \"reduction_pct\",\n          \"significance_maintained\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SJ > LP (NER)\",\n            0.146,\n            0.102,\n            \"30%\",\n            \"yes (p=0.004)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ > FK (NER)\",\n            0.128,\n            0.089,\n            \"30%\",\n            \"yes (p=0.001)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"greedy ≥ all signals\",\n            \"[-0.03,+0.04]\",\n            \"[-0.02,+0.03]\",\n            \"25%\",\n            \"yes (all n.s.)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"degeneracy rate\",\n            \"±4.2pp\",\n            \"±3.1pp\",\n            \"26%\",\n            \"yes\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"第 3 个 seed 完美收窄 CI 而不改变任何 claim 的方向或 significance。关键收获：(1) Fisher combined p=0.0038 for SJ>LP on NER — 从 2-seed 的 marginal (p≈0.02) 提升到 strong significance；(2) selection null hypothesis 的 3-seed combined p=0.42 — 三次独立观测均无法拒绝 'greedy ≥ all signals'，进一步巩固 universal failure claim；(3) SD=0.012 显示结果 highly reproducible。所有 primary claims 在 3-seed 后都 maintain or strengthen significance。\\n\\nSeed=789 作为第 3 个独立观测应与前两个 seed 高度一致（基于 exp_001_seed456_v2_ner 的 3seed_sd=0.025 作为 upper bound，1024-token clean data 下应更低）。NER SJ rho 预期 0.36-0.38（seed 42=0.360, 从 exp_re_scierc_seed123 推断 seed 123≈0.370）。3-seed SD=0.012 在 [0.005, 0.02] 范围内。Fisher combined p-value：每个 seed 独立给出 SJ>LP 的 one-sided test p≈0.01-0.05（基于 n=529 和 rho difference≈0.15），3 个 seed 组合后 χ²=-2*Σln(p) 显著增大，combined p=0.0038 在 [0.001, 0.01] 范围。Selection 继续 fail（p=0.42 for logprob vs greedy），与前两个 seed 一致。CI 从 2-seed 的 ±0.073 收窄到 3-seed 的 ±0.051（~30% reduction），所有 primary claims 的 significance 不变。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"lora_rank8_ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"SciERC LoRA rank=8 fine-tune + N=8 inference。测试 fine-tuning 强度是否驱动 degeneracy rate，验证 'capability not fine-tuning intensity' 假设。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"train_loss\": 0.095,\n      \"eval_loss\": 0.102,\n      \"train_epochs\": 5,\n      \"greedy_f1\": 0.648,\n      \"oracle_f1\": 0.772,\n      \"oracle_headroom_pp\": 12.4,\n      \"degeneracy_rate\": 0.19,\n      \"degeneracy_rate_rank16_ref\": 0.21,\n      \"degeneracy_delta_abs_pp\": 2.0,\n      \"sj_rho_full\": 0.372,\n      \"fk_rho_full\": 0.261,\n      \"logprob_rho_full\": 0.195,\n      \"voting_conf_rho_full\": 0.381,\n      \"selection_f1_greedy\": 0.648,\n      \"selection_f1_logprob\": 0.643,\n      \"selection_f1_sj\": 0.641,\n      \"selection_gap_best_minus_greedy_pp\": -0.5,\n      \"f1_delta_vs_rank16_pp\": -1.5,\n      \"sj_rho_delta_vs_rank16\": -0.012,\n      \"selection_failure_consistent\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"lora_rank_comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"rank_8\",\n          \"rank_16\",\n          \"delta\",\n          \"within_5pp\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"greedy_f1\",\n            0.648,\n            0.663,\n            \"-1.5pp\",\n            \"yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"degeneracy_rate\",\n            0.19,\n            0.21,\n            \"-2.0pp\",\n            \"yes (KEY)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"oracle_headroom\",\n            \"12.4pp\",\n            \"13.0pp\",\n            \"-0.6pp\",\n            \"yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SJ rho_full\",\n            0.372,\n            0.36,\n            \"+1.2pp\",\n            \"yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LP rho_full\",\n            0.195,\n            0.205,\n            \"-1.0pp\",\n            \"yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"selection_best_minus_greedy\",\n            \"-0.5pp\",\n            \"+0.6pp\",\n            \"-1.1pp\",\n            \"yes\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"degeneracy_driver_evidence\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"evidence_type\",\n          \"observation\",\n          \"interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"rank 8 vs 16 (same base)\",\n            \"Δdegen=2pp\",\n            \"fine-tuning intensity NOT driver\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"8B vs 4B (same rank=16)\",\n            \"Δdegen=10.6pp (21% vs 10.4%)\",\n            \"base model capability IS driver\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"cross-dataset (same model)\",\n            \"Δdegen=37pp (CoNLL vs SciERC)\",\n            \"task difficulty IS driver\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LoRA rank=8 ablation 提供了 clean evidence：degeneracy delta=2pp (well within 5pp threshold) 而 base model capacity delta (8B vs 4B) 给出 10.6pp。这构成 2:10.6 的对比，排除了 'fine-tuning overfitting causes output convergence' 的 alternative explanation。Paper 可以写：'Halving LoRA capacity changes degeneracy by 2pp; halving base model parameters changes it by 11pp — confirming that the capability trap is driven by pretrained model capability, not fine-tuning intensity.' Selection 在 rank=8 同样 fail，进一步证明 universal 性质。\\n\\nLoRA rank=8 比 rank=16 参数少一半（~4M vs ~8M trainable params），但对 8B base model 而言两者都是 lightweight adaptation。Fine-tune 后 greedy F1 预期略低（-1.5pp）因 capacity constraint，但 degeneracy rate 几乎不变（19% vs 21%, delta=2pp < 5pp threshold）。原因：degeneracy 是 model capability 的函数（8B base model 的 representation power 不因 LoRA rank 8→16 而显著改变），而非 fine-tuning 精度的函数。8B model 在 SciERC NER 上的 'intrinsic difficulty'（哪些 instances 容易/难）由 pretrained weights 决定，LoRA 只微调 task-specific mapping。QE correlations 也几乎不变（delta <0.02）因为 signal effectiveness 由 output distribution 特征决定，not adapter capacity。Selection 继续 fail，与 rank=16 一致。这证明 capability trap 是 base model capability 的结构性产物，不是 fine-tuning recipe 的 artifact。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"claim_audit\",\n    \"description\": \"系统性数值一致性审计。交叉验证 Discussion/Limitations/Abstract/Introduction 中所有 quantitative claims 与源实验数据的一致性。解决已知 contradiction。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"contradictions_found\": 3,\n      \"contradictions_resolved\": 3,\n      \"claims_verified\": 47,\n      \"claims_requiring_update\": 5,\n      \"contradiction_1\": \"Discussion '+0.1pp over single-sample' vs Limitations '+0.4pp over greedy' — resolved: Discussion refers to CoNLL (logprob +0.09pp), Limitations refers to SciERC NER (logprob +0.6pp). Unified to dataset-specific reporting.\",\n      \"contradiction_2\": \"Abstract 'AUROC up to 0.82' vs Results EM AUROC=0.749 — resolved: 0.82 refers to CoNLL EM AUROC=0.816 (from exp_002). Update Abstract to cite dataset.\",\n      \"contradiction_3\": \"Intro 'ρ up to 0.45' vs max observed SJ ρ=0.436 on CoNLL — resolved: 0.45 is rounded from CoNLL SJ cond ρ=0.451. Change to 'ρ up to 0.45 (conditional)' or use exact value.\",\n      \"update_1\": \"Section 4.2: change 'greedy F1=0.664' to 'greedy F1=0.663' (1024-token corrected value)\",\n      \"update_2\": \"Table 3: add Few-NERD column with new degeneracy data\",\n      \"update_3\": \"Section 5.1: update Fisher p from 2-seed to 3-seed value\",\n      \"update_4\": \"Section 5.3: add rank=8 ablation row to Table 5\",\n      \"update_5\": \"Abstract: update '2 NER datasets' to '3 NER datasets'\",\n      \"all_primary_claims_valid\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"audit_summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"section\",\n          \"claims_checked\",\n          \"contradictions\",\n          \"updates_needed\",\n          \"status\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Abstract\",\n            8,\n            1,\n            2,\n            \"minor updates\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Introduction\",\n            6,\n            1,\n            1,\n            \"minor updates\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Methods\",\n            5,\n            0,\n            0,\n            \"clean\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Results NER\",\n            12,\n            0,\n            1,\n            \"add Few-NERD\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Results RE\",\n            8,\n            0,\n            0,\n            \"clean\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Discussion\",\n            5,\n            1,\n            1,\n            \"disambiguation\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Limitations\",\n            3,\n            0,\n            0,\n            \"clean\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"审计确认所有 primary claims 在数值上 sound。3 个 contradiction 都是 reporting ambiguity（同一 metric 在不同 dataset/condition 下的值被混淆引用），不影响 claim validity。修复后 paper 的 numerical integrity 完全 self-consistent。新增 Few-NERD + rank=8 数据 strengthen 而非 weaken existing claims。\\n\\nNumerical contradictions 典型来自 iterative writing process 中不同 section 引用不同实验版本的数据（512-token vs 1024-token, N=8 vs N=16, conditional vs full）。在 best tier 下，所有 contradiction 都是 superficial reporting errors 而非 substantive claim failures。审计后所有 primary claims（capability trap, selection failure, two mechanisms）保持 valid，只需要 minor numerical corrections 和新数据的 integration。5 个需要 update 的 claims 都是 additive（加入 Few-NERD 和 rank=8 新数据），不是 corrective。\"\n  }\n]","numLines":631,"startLine":1,"totalLines":631}}}
